    {
      "id": "zGbhulCtXr7Rj1d9NPfnO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15.199920654296875,
      "y": 8189,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bpo",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1193184436,
      "version": 448,
      "versionNonce": 1528108468,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776608234817,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "既然线程池已经成了全局唯一的单例，你认为在大型项目中如果多个模块都想往这个\n池子里塞不同类型的任务，我们该如何设计任务接口来保证兼容性呢？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "既然线程池已经成了全局唯一的单例，你认为在大型项目中如果多个模块都想往这个\n池子里塞不同类型的任务，我们该如何设计任务接口来保证兼容性呢？",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qtsrMB-MG_gIeezHGcngA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8.150115966796875,
      "y": 8269.300048828125,
      "width": 798.0997924804688,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bpp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1166606900,
      "version": 88,
      "versionNonce": 631613196,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776608245955,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "最好的方案是使用 **`std::function<void()>` (类型擦除)** 配合 **Lambda 表达式**：\n将不同模块、不同参数、不同签名的逻辑全部包装成统一的“无参无返回”包装器，从而让单\n例线程池能够以一套标准接口处理全项目的异质任务。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "最好的方案是使用 **`std::function<void()>` (类型擦除)** 配合 **Lambda 表达式**：将不同模块、不同参数、不同签名的逻辑全部包装成统一的“无参无返回”包装器，从而让单例线程池能够以一套标准接口处理全项目的异质任务。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
